            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.24.18+2KI.24.19+2KI.24.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ub 24:18-20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.36.11+2CH.36.12+2CH.36.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Kei 36:11-13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man etimbre i rundi nino, i thekri mi camuker pa Zedekia m’ubimo mi Yuda, i rundi mir ang’wende, i dwi mir abije, nia Hanania ma wod Azur, ma jabila, ma en e mi Gibeon, eyero ira i ot pa Yehova, i vut julam man dhanu ceke, ewacu kumae, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova mir udul, Mungu mir Israel, uyero kumeni, ewacu kumae, Aturo mberembere p’ubimo mi Babeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma fodi rundi ario yul kuthum ungo abikelo agulu ceke mi ot pa Yehova kendo kakeni ma Nebukadnezar m’ubimo mi Babeli yaku ku kakeni, m’etero de i Babeli: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man abidwoko Yekonia ma wod Yehoiakim, m’ubimo mi Yuda, karacelo ku ng’eca mi Yuda, m’ucidho Babeli, Yehova wacu; kum abituro mberembere mir ubimo mi Babeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.28.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.28.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E jabila ma Yeremia lund uwacu ni jabila ma Hanania i vut julam man i vut dhanu ceke m’ucungo i ot pa Yehova, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "en e jabila ma Yeremia ewacu kumae, Amen: Yehova tim kumeno; Yehova tim lembe peri m’iewo, m’edwok ko agulu mi ot pa Yehova kendo, man dhanu ceke mi ng’eca, kud i Babeli i kakeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento kawono winj lembe maeni m’ayero i ithi, man i ith dhanu ceke: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.28.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jubila m’ular uwok ira man iri ma con giewo lembe kum ng’om dupa, man kum ker ma dit, mir ali, man mi lem ma rac, man mi thong’om. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jabila m’uewo pi kwiocwiny, kinde ma lembe pa jabila bitimbre, e jabilane bilund ng’eire, nia Yehova ore andha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanania ma jabila lund uting’o utwindi kud i ng’ut jabila ma Yeremia, man eture. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Hanania yero i vut dhanu ceke, ewacu kumae, Yehova wacu kumae: Abituro mberembere pa Nebukadnezar m’ubimo mi Babeli kumeni ma fodi rundi ario yul kuthum ungo kud i ng’ut thek ceke. E jabila ma Yeremia cidho i yo pare.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.28.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lembe pa Yehova lund ubino ba Yeremia, yo ng’ei utwindi ma Hanania ma jabila turo kud i ng’ut Yeremia ma jabila, m’uwacu kumae, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cidhi, man iyer ni Hanania, wac kumae, Yehova wacu kumae: Ituro utwindi mi yen; ento itimo utwindi mi nyunyu ka kagi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum Yehova mir udul, Mungu mir Israel, uwacu kumae: Aketho mberembere mi nyunyu i ng’ut thek maeni ceke, kara gitim ni Nebukadnezar m’ubimo mi Babeli; e gibitimo ire: man amio ire yedi m’i thim bende. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E jabila ma Yeremia lund uwacu ni Hanania ma jabila kumae, Kawono winji, Hanania: Yehova ori ngo; ento iketho dhanu maeni gigeno ndra. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.28.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka kumeno Yehova wacu kumae, Nen, abiori cen kud i wang’ ng’om: i rundi maeni ibitho, kum iyero lemjai kum Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum kumeno Hanania ma jabila tho i rundi nica i dwi mir abirone.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.28.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
